        <p class="small muted footer__blurb">
          Ordinary Living Made Intentional. An independent East African
          editorial and lifestyle company.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="footer__heading">Read</h2>
        <ul class="footer__list">
          <li><a class="footer__link" href="/journal/">Journal</a></li>
          <li><a class="footer__link" href="/seasons/">Seasons</a></li>
          <li><a class="footer__link" href="/directory/">Directory</a></li>
          <li><a class="footer__link" href="/objects/">Objects</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="footer__heading">Company</h2>
        <ul class="footer__list">
          <li><a class="footer__link" href="/about/">About</a></li>
          <li><a class="footer__link" href="/about/#masthead">Masthead</a></li>
          <li><a class="footer__link" href="/styleguide/">Design system</a></li>
